                                "sense_id": "383caf4f-6fc3-339d-8ce3-551c439ed2e7",
                                "text": "The fleeces of black Montadales (which produce a range of grays) are intended only for handspinners and small-scale artisan yarn production, because they are useless to the mass-industrial system."
